        "answer": {
          "short": "$y'=40x^2(2x-5)(2x-3)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}u&=8x^3,&u'&=24x^2\\\\v&=(2x-5)^2,&v'&=2(2x-5)(2)\\\\&&v'&=4(2x-5)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=u'v+uv'\\\\y'&=24x^2(2x-5)^2+8x^3[4(2x-5)]\\\\y'&=24x^2(2x-5)^2+32x^3(2x-5)\\\\y'&=8x^2(2x-5)[3(2x-5)+4x]\\\\y'&=8x^2(2x-5)(10x-15)\\\\y'&=40x^2(2x-5)(2x-3)\\end{align*}$$",
